//=============================================================================
// maps/m1l2b_opm.scr - OpenMoHAA add-on for m1l2b
//
// The Opel that drives off at the start has its headlights on: the level puts
// coronas on its lenses (global/spotlight.scr) but leaves its lights' surface
// hidden, and the renderer's live headlights (lamps.txt, kind headlight)
// follow that surface. Its "idle" animation hides it again whenever it
// starts, and a vehicle starts it over as it drives (Vehicle::
// EventContinueSkidding and others), so it is shown again while the truck is.
//
// An add-on (Level::StartMapAddon), not a change to maps/m1l2b.scr, which
// would break old saves. Runs at level start and on loading a save: the truck
// is gone by then, or is the one driving with its lights on.
//=============================================================================

	if ($truck01 == NULL)
		end

	while ($truck01 != NULL)
	{
		$truck01 surface opellights "-nodraw"
		waitframe
	}
end
